  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d8c8072d2125b034db50ac10816f2018, type: 3}
  m_Name: landmark_2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  text1: "Il existe autant de versions de toi que de choix que tu aies d\xFB prendre."
  text2: "\xC0 chaque d\xE9cision, tu cr\xE9es une version alternative de ta vie
    o\xF9 tu as pris l'autre choix."
  text3: "Tu es d\xE9j\xE0 mort.e dans plusieurs chemins de vie. \xC0 l'inverse,
    il existe un chemin o\xF9 tu n'as jamais connu l'\xE9chec."
  text4: "Parmi toutes ces versions de toi, penses-tu que certaines ont une personnalit\xE9
    profond\xE9ment diff\xE9rente de celle de ce chemin-ci ?"
  text5: 
  text6: 
  answer1: Oui
  answer2: Non
  text1_EN: There are as many versions of you as there are choices you have had to
    make.
  text2_EN: With every decision, you create an alternate version of your life in
    which you made the other choice.
  text3_EN: You are already dead in several possible paths of life. Conversely, there
    is a path where you have never experienced failure.
  text4_EN: Among all these versions of you, do you think some of them have a personality
    that is fundamentally different from the one on this path?
  text5_EN: 
  text6_EN: 
  answer1_EN: 'Yes '
  answer2_EN: No
  type: 2
  nbTexts: 3
